  "title": "WidePoint to Present at the LD Micro Invitational XVI on Monday, May 18, 2026 at 10:30 a.m. PDT",
  "summary": "FAIRFAX, VA / May 5, 2026 / WidePoint Corporation (NYSE American: WYY), a leading provider of Secure Mobile Management Solutions, will be attending the LD Micro Invitational XVI from May 17-19, 2026 at the Luxe Sunset Blvd Hotel in Los Angeles, CA. WidePoint management is scheduled to present on Monday, May 18, 2026, at 10:30 a.m. Pacific Time,",
